  "bio": "Enveloped in the creative ambiance of Eagan, Minnesota, Joseph Christensen Tattoo Studio is a haven for skin art enthusiasts seeking top-notch illustrative and traditional styles. Established in 2009 by the masterful @josephchristensen, this welcoming studio invites both appointments and walk-ins seven days a week, ensuring that every tattoo dream is catered to with excellence and a personal touch. Reach out to us at 651-340-0257 and let us turn your vision into an indelible masterpiece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nExpert tattooing in Eagan & Faribault\nWalk ins available\nAll styles welcomed \n7 days a week\n651-340-0257 \nEst. In 2009 by @josephchristensen\n\nExpert tattooing in Eagan & Faribault\nWalk ins available\nAll styles welcomed \n7 days a week\n651-340-0257 \nEst. In 2009 by @josephchristensen",
